"Probe Flags (Find RW)" = "探测标志位（查找读写权限）";
"Run All tests bad_query availability, sandbox lease, container discovery, and file read operations. Probe Flags enumerates flag combinations to find one that grants read-write access (diagnostic only, results in Console.app filter [GKTL-ObjC])." = "全部运行测试 bad_query 可用性、沙盒租约、容器发现和文件读取操作。探测标志位枚举标志组合，查找可授予读写权限的标志（仅供诊断，结果在 Console.app 筛选 [GKTL-ObjC]）。";
"Flag probe complete. Check Console.app (filter [GKTL-ObjC]) for results.\nLook for lines with canWrite=1 — that flag value grants read-write access." = "标志位探测完成。请在 Console.app 中查看结果（筛选 [GKTL-ObjC]）。\n查找 canWrite=1 的行——该标志值授予读写权限。";
"Lease acquired for file:\n%@" = "已获取文件租约：\n%@";
