"unknown error" = "未知错误";
"[ iOS 26.0.x detected (build %@) ] bad_query's ContainerManager query was accepted but the kernel refused to issue a sandbox extension. This is a known symptom on early iOS 26.0 builds where the sandbox policy differs from iOS 27. Possible causes:\n  1. The MobileGestalt cache plist has not been generated yet — try respringing once, then rerun diagnostics.\n  2. The bad_query exploit parameters (class=13, part=3, flags=0x8000000000) may need adjustment for this specific build.\n  3. Apple may have partially patched bad_query in this build.\n\nCheck the device console (Console.app, filter [GKTL-ObjC]) for detailed per-stage logs showing exactly where the lease acquisition failed (lstat / create / getSingleResult / copySandboxToken / consume)." = "[ 检测到 iOS 26.0.x（版本号 %@）] bad_query 的 ContainerManager 查询已被接受，但内核拒绝签发沙盒扩展。这是 iOS 26.0 早期版本的已知问题，其沙盒策略与 iOS 27 不同。可能原因：\n  1. MobileGestalt 缓存 plist 尚未生成——请尝试注销一次，然后重新运行诊断。\n  2. bad_query 利用参数（class=13, part=3, flags=0x8000000000）可能需要针对此版本进行调整。\n  3. Apple 可能已在此版本中部分修补了 bad_query。\n\n请查看设备控制台（Console.app，筛选 [GKTL-ObjC]）获取详细的分阶段日志，查看租约获取具体在哪一步失败（lstat / create / getSingleResult / copySandboxToken / consume）。";
"Diagnostics complete." = "诊断完成。";

/* GestaltAccess — read-only mode */
"The sandbox extension acquired by bad_query only grants READ access on this iOS build. MobileGestalt values can be viewed but cannot be modified. This is a known limitation of iOS 26.0.x where the group-sacrifice flags (0x0800000000) do not convey write permissions." = "bad_query 获取的沙盒扩展在此 iOS 版本上仅授予读取权限。可以查看 MobileGestalt 值但无法修改。这是 iOS 26.0.x 的已知限制，其组牺牲标志位（0x0800000000）不传达写入权限。";
"bad_query acquired a sandbox extension, but the MobileGestalt plist is neither readable nor writable." = "bad_query 已获取沙盒扩展，但 MobileGestalt plist 既不可读也不可写。";
